OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAHave you seen the hummingbird hawk
OL,4,Amoth?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Benwell, from the Birmingham and
OL,7,FBlack Country Wildlife Trust, said 2026
OL,8,Fwas a "record year" for sightings of
OL,9,Fthe species, which was often mistaken
OL,10,Ffor a small bird.
OL,12,FThe moth, which can be seen hovering
OL,13,Fover flowers, has wings that beat about
OL,14,F80 times per second, according to
OL,15,FBenwell.
